	(text "Internal charge pump from VDD2 = 3.3 V (CH1115: 7.4 V mode from 3.0 V).\nThe panel sheet asks VDD2 >= 3.6 V: lower brightness, verify on the prototype.\nIM1 = GND selects 4-wire SPI. FPC is bottom contact: check the pin 1 side at layout.\nC43/C44/C47/C48: 4.7 uF 25 V, C45/C46: 220 nF 50 V."
